RENDERER MODULE GRAPH
=====================

module-snapshot/ (shipped in the collimate wheel) redistributes the shipped
renderers' frozen browser module graph (from https://esm.sh/ and
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/). Every package and version in it, with its SPDX
license and source, is listed in module-snapshot/LICENSES.json; see
content/renderers/CREDITS.md.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

RENDERER RUNTIME (CDN-LOADED)
=============================

The bundled renderers (content/renderers/, shipped with this app as
collimate_content/renderers/) load their heavy dependencies from public
CDNs at runtime rather than bundling them into the wheel. Those
components have their own licenses; this project neither modifies nor
redistributes their sources. See content/renderers/CREDITS.md for the
canonical list.

Notable ones:
  - Monaco Editor (Microsoft, MIT) — https://github.com/microsoft/monaco-editor
  - Milkdown / Crepe (Milkdown community, MIT) — https://github.com/Milkdown/milkdown
  - Excalidraw (Excalidraw Authors, MIT) — https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw
  - Mermaid (MIT) — https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid
  - KaTeX (MIT) — https://github.com/KaTeX/KaTeX

